\subsection{The answer form}

The form repeats the slide's rules in the respondent's hand, so its
Swedish reuses the slide's words: the scale ends are \enquote{Lägst}
and \enquote{Högst} on both.  Two messages go into the pin form's
script rather than its HTML, the tooltip of a placed pin and the
placeholder of its comment field, whose [[{n}]] the script fills in
