\subsection{The results page}

The results page is read by the lecturer and, with [[--results]], by
the room, so it follows the same setting.  The statistical mode is
\enquote{Typvärde} in Swedish, a different word from the word-cloud
\enquote{Läge} on the slide, which is why the two are separate keys
although both are \enquote{Mode} in English.  Numbers keep the decimal
point in both languages; a Swedish decimal comma would need the number
formatting to follow the locale too, which is a separate change.

