\subsection{Navigation, pacing and the index}

The navigation row, the lecturer's Skip and Reopen controls, the
waiting pages of the paced lecture and the lecturer's index belong
together: they are the words of moving through a deck.  The index
labels each question with its pacing state; the state names stay
English in the HTML's class attribute, where the style sheet reads
them, and only the visible word is translated.

